        "filing_date": "2025-11-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "For example, within our water service offerings, we provide water, wastewater, water supply and water resource services, which are necessary in response to sustainability and resilience, drought mitigation and other factors as part of major capital/infrastructure projects.",
